        "$\\\\angle x=80^\\\\circ,\\\\angle y=100^\\\\circ$",
        "$\\\\angle x=80^\\\\circ,\\\\angle y=110^\\\\circ$",
        "$\\\\angle x=80^\\\\circ,\\\\angle y=120^\\\\circ$",
        "$\\\\angle x=70^\\\\circ,\\\\angle y=100^\\\\circ$",
        "$\\\\angle x=70^\\\\circ,\\\\angle y=110^\\\\circ$"
      ],
      "answer": "①",
      "solution": "삼각형 $BCD$에서\n$\\angle BCD=180^\\circ-30^\\circ-70^\\circ=80^\\circ$이다.\n\n사각형 $ABCD$는 원에 내접하므로 마주 보는 각의 합은 $180^\\circ$이다.\n$y=180^\\circ-80^\\circ=100^\\circ$이다.\n\n따라서 $(x,y)=(80^\\circ,100^\\circ)$이므로 정답은 ①이다.",
